{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "174", "x": 0.8957535496958443, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.037989698907791414, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): If the weather's nice, one thing you could do is visit the old", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.826080692469942, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "fort, but you could get there by boat. The whole trip takes half a day.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1436641300790535, "w": 0.7042687956178374, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): That's a really really good idea. I'd like to do that myself. And if", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.173922722295561, "w": 0.8259881124366563, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "the weather's bad, I was thinking they could go to the science museum, but maybe", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19424346276951368, "w": 0.8263600729690601, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "they could do that when I'm at work.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21471252375881908, "w": 0.37723459544627214, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Yeah, don't forget it's closed on Mondays.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2449711914181116, "w": 0.6458128091191435, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): They're here from Saturday for four nights, so Tuesday would be", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2752669014848498, "w": 0.8264582918748051, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "best, I think.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2955876419588025, "w": 0.13388644008036726, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): And it won't be so crowded then. Saturdays are terrible. I took", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3258462153146138, "w": 0.8263673522407803, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "my kids to the exhibition on old computers there, and it was far too crowded. I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3463152763039192, "w": 0.8265253431945935, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "wanted to go back, but it's finished now.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.36663601677787183, "w": 0.41738106054477864, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): That's a shame. My cousin's kids would have enjoyed that.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39689460899437934, "w": 0.7748190357671629, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): There's another one starting soon on space, which looks", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4271532389322794, "w": 0.8261859855974996, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "really good, too.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.44747397940623207, "w": 0.17379773856608394, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Okay. Well, I'll mention that to my cousin.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.47775731685622674, "w": 0.6059015362646653, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Narrator/Instructor: Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5080159467941268, "w": 0.8261829098488854, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "time to look at questions 7 to 10. now listen and answer questions 7 to 10.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5284850077834321, "w": 0.7506303746784689, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Have you thought about where to take them to eat?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5587435999999396, "w": 0.7453895040898741, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Well, I really like all the food stalls at Clton Market. My cousin's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5890022299378397, "w": 0.8263187554126767, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "vegetarian.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6093229704117924, "w": 0.12400939108071861, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I know it's one of the best places. for that kind of food.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6395816003496924, "w": 0.5604973864851401, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Definitely. And there'll be loads of choice for the kids, too.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6698773104164306, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "You need to get there quite early, though. At the weekend, most of the stores stop", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6903462959629509, "w": 0.826251396518027, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "serving lunch at 2:30.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7106671118796887, "w": 0.228071091418118, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Good point. It's all going to need careful planning. My cousin said", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7409257040961962, "w": 0.8260814101446187, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "she'd love to take the kids to a show at the theater, but tickets are so expensive.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7613947650855015, "w": 0.8218190377151371, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): I know, but you can get some good deals if you book online", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7916533573020091, "w": 0.8260852035679094, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "with bargainant tickets.com for the following day. On some seats, there's a 75%", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8119740977759617, "w": 0.8259899578858247, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "discount.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8322948382499145, "w": 0.10304588309510122, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Really? I must try and get some.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8625781756999091, "w": 0.513531012722014, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Yeah, there are lots of things you can do for free as well. No", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8928368433592017, "w": 0.8260075921778791, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "need to spend a fortune.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.913305828905722, "w": 0.25770221278582545, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}